    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "TAGL - a software rendererer",
      "source_hash": 16870032411304809980,
      "context_hash": 17923360891310906157,
      "translation": "TAGL - 소프트웨어 렌더러",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:29.156800Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This directory contains TAGL, a software renderer that I wrote in the 90's (!) (install LiteOS first, instructions [here](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/tree/master/LiteX/software/LiteOS)).",
      "source_hash": 4807746832505797968,
      "context_hash": 14174347285612516339,
      "translation": "이 디렉터리에는 제가 90년대에 작성한(!) 소프트웨어 렌더러인 TAGL이 들어 있습니다 (먼저 LiteOS를 설치해야 하며, 안내는 [여기](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/tree/master/LiteX/software/LiteOS)에 있습니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:29.156800Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Compile the programs:",
      "source_hash": 9030619178483937355,
      "context_hash": 15183165407840053395,
      "translation": "프로그램을 컴파일하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:29.156800Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Then copy `rotate.elf` to the SDCard as well as all the files in the `Objects` directory.",
      "source_hash": 3893562664680828680,
      "context_hash": 6497126571144811373,
      "translation": "그런 다음 `rotate.elf`와 `Objects` 디렉터리 안의 모든 파일을 SD카드에 복사하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:29.156801Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Connect to the SoC (`lxterm /dev/ttyUSBnnn`), and start the program:",
      "source_hash": 13719649608703719895,
      "context_hash": 9406188544047440707,
      "translation": "SoC에 연결하고(`lxterm /dev/ttyUSBnnn`), 프로그램을 시작하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:29.156801Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "It will display a car.",
      "source_hash": 12373727903095611991,
      "context_hash": 9917585644928155307,
      "translation": "자동차가 표시될 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:55:29.156801Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "Then you can interact with the visualization using:",
